<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - North Amer. Mortgage cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - North Amer. Mortgage cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>UBS Securities said it downgraded North American Mortgage Corp to hold from buy.</p>
<p>-- On Monday, Dime Bancorp said it agreed to acquire North American Mortgage in a deal valued at about $374 million.</p>
<p>-- UBS said, &quot;although we are confident that the transaction will close in the early part of the fourth quarter, we are lowering our rating to hold.&quot;</p>
</text>
